<h2>Under Desk Elliptical vs Treadmill: Which Should You Choose?</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Get an under desk elliptical</strong> if you sit at a regular desk, your work needs focus, you share a space, you have sore joints or you want the lowest cost.</li>
<li><strong>Get an under desk treadmill</strong> if you already own a standing desk, you want steps on your tracker, and much of your day is calls and email.</li>
<li><strong>Get a compact full-size machine</strong> if you want real workouts rather than movement during work.</li>
