<p>Not sure where you fit? Our <a href="/tools/which-under-desk-elliptical-quiz/">which under desk elliptical quiz</a> takes a minute, and the <a href="/under-desk-elliptical-vs-walking-pad/">under desk elliptical vs walking pad</a> comparison goes deeper on slim walking decks.</p>

<h2>Final Verdict</h2>
<p>For most people working at a desk, the under desk elliptical vs treadmill question comes out in favor of the elliptical as the more practical buy. It costs less, needs no new furniture, stays quiet and fits into your workday without changing how you work, which is why owners tend to keep using it. Start with the [[amazon:cubii-jr2|Cubii JR2]].</p>
<p>If you already work at a standing desk and want steps, an under desk treadmill gives you a bit more burn per hour. Either way, consistent daily use beats occasional intense use. To see how seated pedaling stacks up against walking for health, read <a href="/is-under-desk-elliptical-as-good-as-walking/">is an under desk elliptical as good as walking</a>.</p>
